    `s 7(8) that the interest cannot be related to a particular share matters` `the interest cannot be related to a particular share`

-- s 7(9): an interest is to be disregarded where held as bare trustee, only as security by a lender, by reason of a prescribed office, as a company's own shares, or as a prescribed interest.
