      `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the interest by reason of holding an office that the regulations prescribe?
      `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)?
      `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a prescribed interest of a person, or class of persons, that the regulations prescribe?
