    `s 7(9) the interest is to be disregarded` `my interest facts`
    WHERE
        -- Placeholders: the s 7(9) rule does not read the other fields of the record; they are FALSE here.
        `my interest facts` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `I hold the share as bare trustee`, `my ordinary business includes the lending of money`, `I hold the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money`, `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office`, `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)`, `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons`, EMPTY

-- s 7(10): an interest is not disregarded by reason only of remoteness, the manner it arose, or a restraint on exercising a right.
