    `s 7A(4)(a) the directors have had regard to what the paragraph requires` `the directors had regard to the most recent financial statements of the company that comply with section 201(2) and (5)` `the directors had regard to all other circumstances that they know or ought to know affect the value of the company's assets and liabilities`

-- s 7A(4)(b): the directors may rely on valuations of assets or estimates of liabilities that are reasonable in the circumstances.
