      `the matter is a claim the company is entitled to make and can reasonably expect to be met to reduce or extinguish the contingent liability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the matter a claim the company is entitled to make and can reasonably expect to be met to reduce or extinguish the contingent liability?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
