      `the consent is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the consent in writing?
      `it is signed by the public accountant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it signed by the public accountant?
      `it is signed by at least one partner of the firm or limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it signed by at least one partner of the firm or limited liability partnership?
      `it is signed by at least one director of the accounting corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it signed by at least one director of the accounting corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 10(4), does the consent have the form the subsection requires` IS
    `s 10(4) the consent has the form the subsection requires` `the kind of accounting entity` `the consent is in writing` `it is signed by the public accountant` `it is signed by at least one partner of the firm or limited liability partnership` `it is signed by at least one director of the accounting corporation`

-- s 10(4): the person who must sign, by kind of accounting entity.
