GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `Under section 10(4), who must sign the consent` IS
    `s 10(4) who must sign the consent` `the kind of accounting entity`

-- s 10(5): the partners of a firm at the time of its appointment who are public accountants are appointed by the firm's appointment in its own name.
