    `s 61(2) the company is barred from commencing business or exercising a borrowing power` `the company is a public company` `the company has a share capital` `the company has issued a prospectus inviting the public to subscribe for its shares` `a statement in lieu of prospectus has been lodged with the Registrar` `the statement in lieu of prospectus complies with the requirements of this Act` `every director has paid to the company on each share taken or contracted to be taken, for which the director is liable to pay in cash, a proportion equal to the proportion payable on application and allotment on the shares payable in cash` `a declaration in the prescribed form verifying that paragraph (b) has been complied with has been lodged with the Registrar` `the declaration was made by the secretary or one of the directors of the company` `the declaration was made by a registered qualified individual authorised by the company`

