    `s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` `the act is the creation or acquisition by the company of a lien on shares in the company` `the shares are fully paid` `the lien is for an amount payable to the company in respect of the shares` `the act was done in good faith` `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`

@export Under section 76(8)(j), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments?
