    `s 76(8)(j) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an agreement for payment by instalments` `the act is the entering into of an agreement by the company with a subscriber for shares in the company` `the agreement permits the subscriber to make payments for the shares by instalments` `the act was done in good faith` `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`

@export Under section 76(8)(k), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is an allotment of bonus shares?
