@export Under section 76(8)(l), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution?
GIVEN `the act is a redemption of redeemable shares of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act a redemption of redeemable shares of the company?
      `the redemption is in accordance with the company's constitution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the redemption in accordance with the company's constitution?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(8)(l), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution` IS
    `s 76(8)(l) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a redemption in accordance with the constitution` `the act is a redemption of redeemable shares of the company` `the redemption is in accordance with the company's constitution`

@export Under section 76(8)(m), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme?
GIVEN `the company has been admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company been admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore?
      `the company has been removed from that official list` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company been removed from that official list?
      `the company is listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore?
      `the act is the payment of some or all of the costs associated with the scheme, arrangement or plan` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act the payment of some or all of the costs associated with the scheme, arrangement or plan?
      `the scheme, arrangement or plan is one under which any shareholder of the company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the scheme, arrangement or plan is one under which any shareholder of the company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(8)(m), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` IS
    `s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` `the company has been admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore` `the company has been removed from that official list` `the company is listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore` `the act is the payment of some or all of the costs associated with the scheme, arrangement or plan` `the scheme, arrangement or plan is one under which any shareholder of the company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns`

