DECIDE `Under section 76(8A)(a), is the holding an odd-lot` IS
    `s 76(8A)(a) the holding is an odd-lot` `the number of shares the shareholder holds in the company` `the number of shares constituting a board lot`

@export Under section 76(8A)(b), is the amount of shares a board lot?
