GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(8A)(b), is the amount of shares a board lot` IS
    `s 76(8A)(b) the amount of shares is a board lot` `the amount is a standard unit of trading of the securities exchange on which the company is listed`

@export Under section 76(8A)(c), is the act within rounding off any odd-lots?
GIVEN `the act is by a shareholder who owns only odd-lots in the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act by a shareholder who owns only odd-lots in the company?
