    `s 76(8A)(c) the act is within rounding off any odd-lots` `the act is by a shareholder who owns only odd-lots in the company` `the act is the disposal of all such odd-lots`

@export Under section 76(9)(a), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business?
GIVEN `the act is the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons?
      `the act is done by the company in the ordinary course of its business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act done by the company in the ordinary course of its business?
      `the activities of the company are regulated by a written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the activities of the company regulated by a written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance?
      `the activities of the company are subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the activities of the company subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore?
      `the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by other persons, is done in the course of those activities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by other persons, is done in the course of those activities?
      `the loan made by the company, or the loan the guarantee or security is given in respect of, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the loan made by the company, or the loan the guarantee or security is given in respect of, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9)(a), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` IS
    `s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` `the act is the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons` `the act is done by the company in the ordinary course of its business` `the activities of the company are regulated by a written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance` `the activities of the company are subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore` `the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by other persons, is done in the course of those activities` `the loan made by the company, or the loan the guarantee or security is given in respect of, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise`

@export Under section 76(9)(b), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees?
GIVEN `the act is the giving by the company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the act the giving by the company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company?
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares or units of shares to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company?
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of a corporation that is related to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares or units of shares to be held by or for the benefit of employees of a corporation that is related to the company?
      `the other corporation is deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other corporation deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6?
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares or units of shares to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9)(b), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` IS
    `s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` `the act is the giving by the company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company` `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of a corporation that is related to the company` `the other corporation is deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6` `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation`

@export Under section 76(9)(c), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a buy-back in accordance with sections 76B to 76G?
GIVEN `the purchase or acquisition, or proposed purchase or acquisition, by the company of its own shares is in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the purchase or acquisition, or proposed purchase or acquisition, by the company of its own shares is in accordance with sections 76B to 76G?
