    `s 76(9)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a buy-back in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` `the purchase or acquisition, or proposed purchase or acquisition, by the company of its own shares is in accordance with sections 76B to 76G`


§§ `Section 76(9A) to (9D): the routes by the directors' resolution and solvency statement, and what ends them`

@export Under section 76(9A)(a), is the assistance within 10 percent of paid-up capital and reserves?
GIVEN `the amount of the financial assistance, in Singapore dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the financial assistance, in Singapore dollars?
      `the amount of other financial assistance given by the company under subsection (9A) and still outstanding, in Singapore dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of other financial assistance the company has given under subsection (9A), repayment of which remains outstanding, in Singapore dollars?
      `the total paid-up capital of the company, in Singapore dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total paid-up capital of the company, in Singapore dollars, as disclosed in its most recent financial statements that comply with section 201?
      `the reserves of the company, in Singapore dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the reserves of the company, in Singapore dollars, as disclosed in its most recent financial statements that comply with section 201?
      `those figures are disclosed in the most recent financial statements of the company that comply with section 201` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are those figures disclosed in the most recent financial statements of the company that comply with section 201?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(a), is the assistance within 10 percent of paid-up capital and reserves` IS
    `s 76(9A)(a) the assistance is within 10 percent of paid-up capital and reserves` `the amount of the financial assistance, in Singapore dollars` `the amount of other financial assistance given by the company under subsection (9A) and still outstanding, in Singapore dollars` `the total paid-up capital of the company, in Singapore dollars` `the reserves of the company, in Singapore dollars` `those figures are disclosed in the most recent financial statements of the company that comply with section 201`

@export Under section 76(9A)(b), does the company receive fair value?
GIVEN `the company receives fair value in connection with the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the company receive fair value in connection with the financial assistance?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(b), does the company receive fair value` IS
    `s 76(9A)(b) the company receives fair value` `the company receives fair value in connection with the financial assistance`

@export Under section 76(9A)(c), has the board passed the resolution the paragraph requires?
GIVEN `the board of directors of the company has passed a resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the board of directors of the company passed a resolution?
      `the resolution says the company should give the assistance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution say the company should give the assistance?
      `the resolution says giving the assistance is in the best interests of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution say giving the assistance is in the best interests of the company?
      `the resolution says the terms and conditions under which the assistance is given are fair and reasonable to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution say the terms and conditions under which the assistance is given are fair and reasonable to the company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(c), has the board passed the resolution the paragraph requires` IS
    `s 76(9A)(c) the board has passed the resolution the paragraph requires` `the board of directors of the company has passed a resolution` `the resolution says the company should give the assistance` `the resolution says giving the assistance is in the best interests of the company` `the resolution says the terms and conditions under which the assistance is given are fair and reasonable to the company`

@export Under section 76(9A)(d), does the resolution set out the grounds?
GIVEN `the resolution sets out in full the grounds for the directors' conclusions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the resolution set out in full the grounds for the directors' conclusions?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(d), does the resolution set out the grounds` IS
    `s 76(9A)(d) the resolution sets out the grounds` `the resolution sets out in full the grounds for the directors' conclusions`

-- The statement the person describes is the solvency statement made for this giving of financial assistance (assumed); the Solvency statement record is built here from the answers.
@export Under section 76(9A)(e), have all the directors made a solvency statement?
GIVEN `the date of the statement` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the statement made?
      `the statement is a statement by the directors of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement a statement by the directors of the company?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that, as regards the company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which the company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that, as regards the company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which the company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement?
      `the number of directors of the company` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors does the company have?
      `the number of directors who have signed the statement as a written declaration` IS A NUMBER @desc How many directors have signed the statement as a written declaration?
      `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances?
      `the company is exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C?
      `all the directors of the company have made the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have all the directors of the company made the statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(e), have all the directors made a solvency statement` IS
    `s 76(9A)(e) all the directors have made a solvency statement` `my statement` `the company is exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C` `all the directors of the company have made the statement`
    WHERE
        `my statement` MEANS `Solvency statement` WITH
            `the proposal it concerns` IS `a giving of financial assistance under section 76(9A) or (9B)`
            `the date of the statement` IS `the date of the statement`
            `it is a statement by the directors of the company` IS `the statement is a statement by the directors of the company`
            `it says the directors have formed the opinion that, as regards the company's situation at its date, there is no ground on which the company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts` IS `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that, as regards the company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which the company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts`
            `it says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up` IS `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up`
            `it says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after its date` IS `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement`
            `it says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)`
            `it says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)`
            `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after its date` IS `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after the date of the statement`
            `the number of directors of the company` IS `the number of directors of the company`
            `the number of directors who have signed it as a written declaration` IS `the number of directors who have signed the statement as a written declaration`
            `it is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances`

@export Under section 76(9A)(f), has the company sent each member the notice in time?
GIVEN `the day the financial assistance was provided` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the financial assistance provided?
      `the day the notice was sent to each member` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice sent to each member?
      `the company has sent each member a notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company sent each member a notice?
      `the notice gives the class and number of shares or units of shares in respect of which the financial assistance was or is to be given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice give the class and number of shares or units of shares in respect of which the financial assistance was or is to be given?
      `the notice gives the consideration paid or payable for those shares or units of shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice give the consideration paid or payable for those shares or units of shares?
      `the notice gives the identity of the person receiving the financial assistance and, if that person is not the beneficial owner, the identity of the beneficial owner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice give the identity of the person receiving the financial assistance and, if that person is not the beneficial owner, the identity of the beneficial owner?
      `the notice gives the nature and, if quantifiable, the amount of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the notice give the nature and, if quantifiable, the amount of the financial assistance?
      `the public holidays` IS A LIST OF DATE @desc Which public holidays in Singapore fall in the period being counted? (List their dates; leave the list empty if there are none.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(f), has the company sent each member the notice in time` IS
    `s 76(9A)(f) the company has sent each member the notice in time` `the day the financial assistance was provided` `the day the notice was sent to each member` `the company has sent each member a notice` `the notice gives the class and number of shares or units of shares in respect of which the financial assistance was or is to be given` `the notice gives the consideration paid or payable for those shares or units of shares` `the notice gives the identity of the person receiving the financial assistance and, if that person is not the beneficial owner, the identity of the beneficial owner` `the notice gives the nature and, if quantifiable, the amount of the financial assistance` `the public holidays`

@export Under section 76(9A)(g), has the company lodged the copies with the Registrar in time?
GIVEN `the day the notice was sent to each member` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice sent to each member?
      `the day the company lodged the copies with the Registrar` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the company lodge the copies with the Registrar?
      `the company lodged a copy of the notice with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the company lodged a copy of the notice with the Registrar?
      `the company lodged a copy of the solvency statement with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the company lodged a copy of the solvency statement with the Registrar?
      `the public holidays` IS A LIST OF DATE @desc Which public holidays in Singapore fall in the period being counted? (List their dates; leave the list empty if there are none.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A)(g), has the company lodged the copies with the Registrar in time` IS
    `s 76(9A)(g) the company has lodged the copies with the Registrar in time` `the day the notice was sent to each member` `the day the company lodged the copies with the Registrar` `the company lodged a copy of the notice with the Registrar` `the company lodged a copy of the solvency statement with the Registrar` `the public holidays`

@export Under section 76(9A), does subsection (1) not prohibit the giving of the assistance?
GIVEN `the condition in paragraph (a) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (a) of section 76(9A) met: the assistance is within 10 percent of paid-up capital and reserves?
      `the condition in paragraph (b) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (b) of section 76(9A) met: the company receives fair value?
      `the condition in paragraph (c) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (c) of section 76(9A) met: the board has passed the resolution the paragraph requires?
      `the condition in paragraph (d) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (d) of section 76(9A) met: the resolution sets out the grounds?
      `the condition in paragraph (e) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (e) of section 76(9A) met: all the directors have made a solvency statement?
      `the condition in paragraph (f) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (f) of section 76(9A) met: the company has sent each member the notice in time?
      `the condition in paragraph (g) of subsection (9A) is met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the condition in paragraph (g) of section 76(9A) met: the company has lodged the copies with the Registrar in time?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(9A), does subsection (1) not prohibit the giving of the assistance` IS
    `s 76(9A) subsection (1) does not prohibit the giving of the assistance` `the condition in paragraph (a) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (b) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (c) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (d) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (e) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (f) of subsection (9A) is met` `the condition in paragraph (g) of subsection (9A) is met`

