DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(c), are the notice and the statement as the paragraph requires` IS
    `s 76(10)(c) the notice and the statement are as the paragraph requires` `the notice specifying the intention to propose the special resolution sets out particulars of the financial assistance proposed to be given and the reasons for the proposal` `the notice sets out the effect that the giving of the financial assistance would have on the financial position of the company and, where the company is in a group of corporations, of the group` `the notice is accompanied by a copy of a statement made in accordance with a resolution of the directors` `the statement sets out the names of any directors who voted against the resolution and the reasons why they so voted` `the number of directors who signed the statement` `the statement states whether, in the opinion of the directors who voted in favour of the resolution, the giving of the financial assistance would be likely to prejudice materially the interests of the creditors or members of the company or any class of them`

@export Under section 76(10)(d), is the notice to the parent accompanied by the notice and statement?
GIVEN `paragraph (b) applies to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does paragraph (b) of section 76(10) apply to the company, that is, is it a subsidiary of a listed corporation, or a subsidiary whose ultimate holding company is incorporated in Singapore?
      `the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) is accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(d), is the notice to the parent accompanied by the notice and statement` IS
    `s 76(10)(d) the notice to the parent is accompanied by the notice and statement` `paragraph (b) applies to the company` `the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) is accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)`

@export Under section 76(10)(e), have the copies been lodged with the Registrar in time?
