      `a copy of the notice was lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a copy of the notice lodged with the Registrar?
      `a copy of the statement that accompanied the notice was lodged with the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a copy of the statement that accompanied the notice lodged with the Registrar?
