DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(e), have the copies been lodged with the Registrar in time` IS
    `s 76(10)(e) the copies have been lodged with the Registrar in time` `the day the notice was despatched to members of the company` `the day the copies were lodged with the Registrar` `a copy of the notice was lodged with the Registrar` `a copy of the statement that accompanied the notice was lodged with the Registrar`

