GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(f), have the notice and the statement been sent to the members and debenture holders` IS
    `s 76(10)(f) the notice and the statement have been sent to the members and debenture holders` `the notice and the statement were sent to all members of the company` `the notice and the statement were sent to all trustees for debenture holders of the company` `there are debenture holders, or debenture holders of a class, of the company for whom there is no trustee` `the notice and the statement were sent to all such debenture holders whose names were known to the company when the notice was despatched`

