@export Under section 76(10)(j), is the assistance given in accordance with the resolution and not too early?
GIVEN `the financial assistance is given in accordance with the terms of the resolution mentioned in paragraph (a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the financial assistance given in accordance with the terms of the resolution mentioned in paragraph (a)?
      `the day the financial assistance is given` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the financial assistance given (or to be given)?
      `the day the notice was published` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the notice of the special resolution published in a daily newspaper?
      `an application opposing the giving of the financial assistance was made within the period mentioned in subsection (12)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was an application opposing the giving of the financial assistance made within the period mentioned in subsection (12)?
