      `the day of the decision of the Court on the application or applications` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the Court decide the application or applications? (Give any day if it has not.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 76(10)(j), is the assistance given in accordance with the resolution and not too early` IS
    `s 76(10)(j) the assistance is given in accordance with the resolution and not too early` `the financial assistance is given in accordance with the terms of the resolution mentioned in paragraph (a)` `the day the financial assistance is given` `the day the notice was published` `an application opposing the giving of the financial assistance was made within the period mentioned in subsection (12)` `each such application has been withdrawn` `the day of the withdrawal of the application or of the last of the applications to be withdrawn` `the day of the decision of the Court on the application or applications`

-- Paragraphs (b), (d) and (g) speak only of the parent where paragraph (b) applies; the route function reads the answer NOTHING there as "nothing asked" (fork F-A13).
@export Under section 76(10), does subsection (1) not prohibit the giving of the assistance?
