      `the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) is accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)?
      `the notice and the accompanying documents were sent to all members of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the notice and the accompanying documents sent to all members of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company?
      `the notice and the accompanying documents were sent to all trustees for debenture holders of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the notice and the accompanying documents sent to all trustees for debenture holders of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company?
