DECIDE `Under section 76(10), does subsection (1) not prohibit the giving of the assistance` IS
    `s 76(10) subsection (1) does not prohibit the giving of the assistance` (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (a) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`s 76(10)(b) the listed corporation or ultimate holding company has approved the giving by special resolution` `paragraph (b) applies to the company` `the listed corporation or the ultimate holding company has, by special resolution, approved the giving of the financial assistance`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (c) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`s 76(10)(d) the notice to the parent is accompanied by the notice and statement` `paragraph (b) applies to the company` `the notice specifying the intention to propose the resolution referred to in paragraph (b) is accompanied by a copy of the notice and a copy of the statement mentioned in paragraph (c)`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (e) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (f) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`s 76(10)(g) the notice and the documents have been sent to the members and debenture holders of the parent` `paragraph (b) applies to the company` `the notice and the accompanying documents were sent to all members of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company` `the notice and the accompanying documents were sent to all trustees for debenture holders of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company` `there are debenture holders, or debenture holders of a class, of the listed corporation or ultimate holding company for whom there is no trustee` `the notice and the accompanying documents were sent to all such debenture holders whose names were known to the listed corporation or ultimate holding company when the notice was despatched`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (h) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (i) of section 76(10) is complied with`) (`Under section 76(10), the answer a paragraph gives when the person says whether it is complied with` `the requirement in paragraph (j) of section 76(10) is complied with`)

