@export Under section 78B(3), does the company meet the solvency requirements?
GIVEN `the date of the solvency statement` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the solvency statement?
      `the statement is a statement by the directors of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement a statement by the directors of the company?
