      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after its date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after its date?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say that the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after its date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after its date?
      `the number of directors of the company` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of directors of the company?
      `the number of directors who have signed it as a written declaration` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of directors who have signed it as a written declaration?
      `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances?
      `the company is exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C?
      `all the directors of the company make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction of capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do all the directors of the company make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction of capital?
      `the resolution date` IS A DATE @desc What is the resolution date?
      `the last day by which subsection (4)(a) must be complied with` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day by which subsection (4)(a) must be complied with?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 78B(3), does the company meet the solvency requirements` IS
    `s 78B(3) the company meets the solvency requirements` (`Solvency statement` OF `a reduction of share capital under section 78B or 78C`, `the date of the solvency statement`, `the statement is a statement by the directors of the company`, `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that, as regards the company's situation at its date, there is no ground on which the company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts`, `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts in full within 12 months after the commencement of winding up`, `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due during the 12 months immediately after its date`, `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)`, `the statement says the directors have formed the opinion that the value of the company's assets will not, after the proposal, become less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)`, `the directors intend to commence winding up of the company within the 12 months immediately after its date`, `the number of directors of the company`, `the number of directors who have signed it as a written declaration`, `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances`) `the company is exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C` `all the directors of the company make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction of capital` `the resolution date` `the last day by which subsection (4)(a) must be complied with`

