      `the statement is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances?
      `the company is exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company exempt from audit requirements under section 205B or 205C?
      `all the directors of the company make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction of share capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do all the directors of the company make the solvency statement in relation to the reduction of share capital?
