-- s 156(7). A declaration under subsection (6)(a) must be made at the first meeting of the directors held after the person becomes a director or chief executive
-- officer or, if already one, after the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property. The layer-1 function takes the dates of the meetings as a LIST;
-- this question asks for the dates of the next three meetings, one by one, and builds the list inside (a person cannot state a list).
@export Under section 156(7), at which meeting of the directors must a person declare a conflict of duty or interest?
GIVEN `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date the person became a director or chief executive officer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date the person became a director or chief executive officer?
      `the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A DATE @desc What is the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date of the next meeting of the directors` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the next meeting of the directors?
      `the date of the meeting of the directors after that` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the meeting of the directors after that?
      `the date of the meeting of the directors after that one` IS A DATE @desc What is the date of the meeting of the directors after that one?
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under section 156(7), at which meeting of the directors must a person declare a conflict of duty or interest` IS
    `s 156(7) the meeting of the directors at which the declaration under subsection (6)(a) must be made` `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the date the person became a director or chief executive officer` `the date the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the dates of the meetings of the directors`
    WHERE
        `the dates of the meetings of the directors` MEANS LIST `the date of the next meeting of the directors`, `the date of the meeting of the directors after that`, `the date of the meeting of the directors after that one`

@export Under section 156(8), from what date must the written notice of a conflict be given as soon as practicable?
GIVEN `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
      `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer?
      `the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` IS A DATE @desc What is the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property?
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `Under section 156(8), from what date must the written notice of a conflict be given as soon as practicable` IS
    `s 156(8) the date after which the written notice under subsection (6)(b) must be given as soon as practicable` `the person was already a director or chief executive officer when he or she commenced to hold the office or to possess the property` `the date on which the person became a director or chief executive officer` `the date on which the person commenced to hold the office or to possess the property`

