    `s 156(14) the section derogates from the rule of law or the provision in the constitution` `a rule of law or a provision in the constitution restricts a director or chief executive officer from having an interest in transactions with the company or from holding offices or possessing properties involving duties or interests in conflict` `the matter is one to which subsection (4) applies`

