    `s 163(7) the director is guilty of the offence` `the company contravened section 163` `the director authorised the making of the loan or quasi-loan, the entering into of the credit transaction, guarantee or arrangement, or the providing of the security, contrary to section 163`

@export Under section 163(7), what is the highest fine the director may be sentenced to on conviction, in Singapore dollars?
