      `the director authorised the making of the loan or quasi-loan, the entering into of the credit transaction, guarantee or arrangement, or the providing of the security, contrary to section 163` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you authorise the dealing that contravened section 163?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 163(7), what is the highest fine the director may be sentenced to on conviction, in Singapore dollars` IS
    CONSIDER `s 163(7) the most the director may be sentenced to on conviction` `the company contravened section 163` `the director authorised the making of the loan or quasi-loan, the entering into of the credit transaction, guarantee or arrangement, or the providing of the security, contrary to section 163`
    WHEN JUST p THEN JUST (p's `s 163(7) the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

@export Under section 163(7), what is the longest term of imprisonment the director may be sentenced to on conviction, in years?
GIVEN `the company contravened section 163` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the company contravene section 163?
      `the director authorised the making of the loan or quasi-loan, the entering into of the credit transaction, guarantee or arrangement, or the providing of the security, contrary to section 163` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you authorise the dealing that contravened section 163?
