@export Under section 163(6), does section 163 operate to prevent the recovery of the amount or the enforcement of the guarantee or security?
GIVEN `the amount is owed under a loan, quasi-loan, credit transaction or arrangement, or is secured by a guarantee or security, made or given by the company or any other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the amount owed under a loan, quasi-loan, credit transaction or arrangement, or secured by a guarantee or security, made or given by the company or any other person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
