§§ `Section 164: the register of directors' and chief executive officers' shareholdings`

@export Under section 164(1), must the company show the particulars of the holding in its register of the director's shareholdings?
GIVEN `the kind of holding` IS A `s 164(1) kind of holding` @desc Which kind of holding is it: shares, debentures or participatory interests, rights or options, contracts to call for or deliver shares, or some other holding?
      `the director holds the item, or has the interest, right or benefit the paragraph names` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold it, or have an interest, right or benefit in it, as the kind of holding describes?
      `the item is shares in a related corporation that is a wholly-owned subsidiary of the company or of another corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares in a related corporation that is a wholly-owned subsidiary of the company or of another corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 164(1), must the company show the particulars of the holding in its register of the director's shareholdings` IS
    `s 164(1) the company must show the particulars of the holding in its register of the director's shareholdings` `the kind of holding` `the director holds the item, or has the interest, right or benefit the paragraph names` `the item is shares in a related corporation that is a wholly-owned subsidiary of the company or of another corporation`

@export Under section 164(1A), must the company show the particulars of the holding in its register of the chief executive officer's shareholdings?
GIVEN `the kind of holding` IS A `s 164(1A) kind of holding` @desc Which kind of holding is it: shares, debentures, rights or options, contracts to call for or deliver shares, or some other holding?
      `the chief executive officer holds the item, or has the interest, right or benefit the paragraph names` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold it, or have an interest, right or benefit in it, as the kind of holding describes?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 164(1A), must the company show the particulars of the holding in its register of the chief executive officer's shareholdings` IS
    `s 164(1A) the company must show the particulars of the holding in its register of the chief executive officer's shareholdings` `the kind of holding` `the chief executive officer holds the item, or has the interest, right or benefit the paragraph names`

@export Under section 164(1)(a), does the director have an interest in the shares?
GIVEN `I have authority to dispose of, or to control the disposal of, the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of the shares, or to control their disposal?
      `I have an interest under a trust whose property includes the shares` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does property held in trust include the shares, and do you have an interest under that trust?
      `I know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that I have that interest under the trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that you have that interest under the trust?
      `I have entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you entered into a contract to purchase a share?
      `I have a right to have a share transferred to me or to my order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have a right (other than as a beneficiary of a trust) to have a share transferred to you or to your order?
      `I have the right to acquire a share, or an interest in one, under an option` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option?
      `I am entitled to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share I do not hold as registered holder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you entitled (other than as a proxy or representative at a meeting) to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which you are not the registered holder?
      `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or issued for one and held by the scheme's manager` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager?
      `I hold the share as bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the share as bare trustee?
      `my ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your ordinary business include the lending of money?
      `I hold the interest only by way of security for an ordinary-course money-lending transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money?
      `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office?
      `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares bought under sections 76B to 76G` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)?
      `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 164(1)(a), does the director have an interest in the shares` IS
    `s 164(1)(a) the director has an interest in the shares` `my interest facts`
    WHERE
        `my interest facts` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
            `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS `I have authority to dispose of, or to control the disposal of, the shares`
            `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS `I have an interest under a trust whose property includes the shares`
            `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS `I know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that I have that interest under the trust`
            `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS `I have entered into a contract to purchase a share`
            `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS `I have a right to have a share transferred to me or to my order`
            `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS `I have the right to acquire a share, or an interest in one, under an option`
            `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS `I am entitled to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share I do not hold as registered holder`
            `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or issued for one and held by the scheme's manager`
            `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS `I hold the share as bare trustee`
            `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS `my ordinary business includes the lending of money`
            `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS `I hold the interest only by way of security for an ordinary-course money-lending transaction`
            `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office`
            `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares bought under sections 76B to 76G`
            `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons`
            -- Not asked: an interest held only through a body corporate under section 7(4). The list is left empty, so a person whose only interest runs through a body corporate answers as if they had none (see NOTES.md, Seams).
            `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

@export Under section 164(14), does the person have an interest in the debenture or participatory interest?
GIVEN `I have authority to dispose of, or to control the disposal of, the debentures or participatory interests` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of the debentures or participatory interests, or to control their disposal?
      `I have an interest under a trust whose property includes the debentures or participatory interests` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does property held in trust include the debentures or participatory interests, and do you have an interest under that trust?
      `I know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that I have that interest under the trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that you have that interest under the trust?
      `I have entered into a contract to purchase a debenture or participatory interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you entered into a contract to purchase a debenture or participatory interest?
      `I have a right to have a debenture or participatory interest transferred to me or to my order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have a right (other than as a beneficiary of a trust) to have a debenture or participatory interest transferred to you or to your order?
      `I have the right to acquire a debenture or participatory interest, or an interest in one, under an option` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have the right to acquire a debenture or participatory interest, or an interest in a debenture or participatory interest, under an option?
      `I am entitled to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a debenture or participatory interest I do not hold as registered holder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you entitled (other than as a proxy or representative at a meeting) to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a debenture or participatory interest of which you are not the registered holder?
      `I hold the debenture or participatory interest as bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the debenture or participatory interest as bare trustee?
      `my ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your ordinary business include the lending of money?
      `I hold the interest only by way of security for an ordinary-course money-lending transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money?
      `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office?
      `the interest is a company's interest in its own debentures or participatory interests bought under sections 76B to 76G` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a company's interest in its own debentures or participatory interests purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)?
      `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the interest a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 164(14), does the person have an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` IS
    `s 164(14) the person has an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` `my interest facts`
    WHERE
        `my interest facts` MEANS `s 7 interest facts` WITH
            `the person has authority (formal or informal, express or implied) to dispose of, or to exercise control over the disposal of, the shares` IS `I have authority to dispose of, or to control the disposal of, the debentures or participatory interests`
            `property held in trust consists of or includes the shares and the person has an interest under the trust` IS `I have an interest under a trust whose property includes the debentures or participatory interests`
            `the person knows, or has reasonable grounds for believing, that the person has that interest under the trust` IS `I know, or have reasonable grounds to believe, that I have that interest under the trust`
            `the person has entered into a contract to purchase a share` IS `I have entered into a contract to purchase a debenture or participatory interest`
            `the person has a right, otherwise than by reason of having an interest under a trust, to have a share transferred to the person or to the person's order` IS `I have a right to have a debenture or participatory interest transferred to me or to my order`
            `the person has the right to acquire a share, or an interest in a share, under an option` IS `I have the right to acquire a debenture or participatory interest, or an interest in one, under an option`
            `the person is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a share of which the person is not the registered holder` IS `I am entitled to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to a debenture or participatory interest I do not hold as registered holder`
            `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS `I hold the debenture or participatory interest as bare trustee`
            `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money` IS `my ordinary business includes the lending of money`
            `the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS `I hold the interest only by way of security for an ordinary-course money-lending transaction`
            `the person holds the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office` IS `I hold the interest by reason of holding a prescribed office`
            `the interest is a company's interest in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (including treasury shares)` IS `the interest is a company's interest in its own debentures or participatory interests bought under sections 76B to 76G`
            `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons` IS `the interest is a prescribed interest of a prescribed person or class of persons`
            -- Section 164(14) applies section 7 except subsection (3), so the unit field is not asked and is set to FALSE.
            `the thing is a unit in a collective investment scheme that has been subscribed or purchased on an offer of units, or is issued for such an offer and held by the scheme's manager` IS FALSE
            -- Not asked: an interest held only through a body corporate under section 7(4). The list is left empty, so a person whose only interest runs through a body corporate answers as if they had none (see NOTES.md, Seams).
            `the bodies corporate through which the person may be deemed to have the interest` IS EMPTY

