      `the directors have taken reasonable steps to cause adequate provision to be made for the difference between the amount of the value as so shown and the amount that they might be expected so to realise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the directors have taken reasonable steps to cause adequate provision to be made for the difference between the amount of the value as so shown and the amount that they might be expected so to realise?
