    `s 207(5) the auditor is entitled to require information and explanations from the person` `the person asking is an auditor of the company` `the person the auditor asks` `the company is the holding company of the corporation of which the person asked is the auditor` `the company is a subsidiary of the corporation of which the person asked is the auditor` `the company is a subsidiary of the holding company of the corporation of which the person asked is the auditor` `they are information and explanations that the auditor desires for the purposes of audit`

-- The auditor, or an agent authorised by the auditor in writing, is entitled to attend any general meeting. NOTHING: the text names no one else.
