      `my position in the company` IS A `s 4(1) "officer" what the person is` @desc What is your position in the company: a director, the secretary, a person employed in an executive capacity, a receiver and manager under an instrument, a liquidator in a voluntary winding up, a receiver who is not also a manager, a receiver and manager appointed by the Court, a liquidator appointed by the Court or the creditors, a judicial manager, or anyone else?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 212(3), am I guilty of the offence as an officer in default` IS
    `s 212(3) the officer is guilty of the offence` `the company is in default of section 212` `I am an officer in default of section 212` `my position in the company`

@export Under section 212(3), what is the most I may be sentenced to on conviction?
GIVEN `the company is in default of section 212` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company made default in complying with section 212?
      `I am an officer in default of section 212` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer of the company who is in default?
      `my position in the company` IS A `s 4(1) "officer" what the person is` @desc What is your position in the company: a director, the secretary, a person employed in an executive capacity, a receiver and manager under an instrument, a liquidator in a voluntary winding up, a receiver who is not also a manager, a receiver and manager appointed by the Court, a liquidator appointed by the Court or the creditors, a judicial manager, or anyone else?
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 210(9) penalty`
DECIDE `Under section 212(3), what is the most I may be sentenced to on conviction` IS
    `s 212(3) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` (`s 212(3) the officer is guilty of the offence` `the company is in default of section 212` `I am an officer in default of section 212` `my position in the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE)

@export Under section 212(4), is the vesting order unable yet to have effect in vesting the land because the entries have not been made?
