§§ `Section 215A: amalgamation`

-- s 215A. Two or more companies may amalgamate and continue as one company, which may be one of the amalgamating companies or a new company, in accordance with sections 215B to 215G.
@export Under section 215A, may the companies amalgamate and continue as one company?
GIVEN `the number of companies that amalgamate` IS A NUMBER @desc How many companies are to amalgamate?
      `the amalgamated company` IS A `s 215A the amalgamated company` @desc What will the amalgamated company be: one of the amalgamating companies, a new company, or some other company?
      `the amalgamation is in accordance with sections 215B to 215G` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the amalgamation made in accordance with sections 215B to 215G, so far as they apply?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215A, may the companies amalgamate and continue as one company` IS
    `s 215A the companies may amalgamate and continue as one company` `the number of companies that amalgamate` `the amalgamated company` `the amalgamation is in accordance with sections 215B to 215G`

@export Under section 215A, is the amalgamated company one of the amalgamating companies or a new company?
GIVEN `the amalgamated company` IS A `s 215A the amalgamated company` @desc What will the amalgamated company be: one of the amalgamating companies, a new company, or some other company?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215A, is the amalgamated company one of the amalgamating companies or a new company` IS
    `s 215A the amalgamated company is one of the amalgamating companies or a new company` `the amalgamated company`

§§ `Section 215B: the amalgamation proposal`

-- s 215B(1). The proposal must contain the terms of the amalgamation and, in particular, what paragraphs (a) to (i) list.
@export Under section 215B(1), does the amalgamation proposal contain what the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the proposal states the name of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the amalgamation proposal state the name of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states the registered office of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the registered office of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states the full name of every director of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the full name of every director of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states each director's residential address and contact address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the residential address and contact address of every director of the amalgamated company, as contained in the register of directors kept by the Registrar?
      `the proposal states the number of shares of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the number of shares of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states the rights and conditions attached to each share` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the rights, privileges, limitations and conditions attached to each share of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states whether the shares are transferable and on what conditions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state whether the shares are transferable or non-transferable and, if transferable, whether their transfer is subject to any condition or limitation?
      `the proposal includes a copy of the constitution of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it include a copy of the constitution of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states how the shares of each amalgamating company are to be converted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the manner in which the shares of each amalgamating company are to be converted into shares of the amalgamated company?
      `some shares of an amalgamating company are not to be converted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are some shares of an amalgamating company not to be converted into shares of the amalgamated company?
      `the proposal states what the holders of those shares are to receive instead` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the consideration that the holders of those shares are to receive instead?
      `a payment is to be made to a member or director of an amalgamating company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a payment to be made to a member or director of an amalgamating company, other than for shares that are not converted?
      `the proposal states that payment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that payment?
      `the proposal gives details of the arrangements to complete the amalgamation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it give details of any arrangement necessary to complete the amalgamation and to provide for the subsequent management and operation of the amalgamated company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215B(1), does the amalgamation proposal contain what the subsection requires` IS
    `s 215B(1) the amalgamation proposal contains what the subsection requires` `the proposal contents`
    WHERE
         `the proposal contents` MEANS `s 215B(1) what the proposal contains` WITH
             `s 215B(1)(a) the name of the amalgamated company is stated` IS `the proposal states the name of the amalgamated company`
             `s 215B(1)(b) the registered office of the amalgamated company is stated` IS `the proposal states the registered office of the amalgamated company`
             `s 215B(1)(c) the full name of every director of the amalgamated company is stated` IS `the proposal states the full name of every director of the amalgamated company`
             `s 215B(1)(ca) the residential address and contact address of every director of the amalgamated company which is contained in the register of directors kept by the Registrar under section 173(1)(a) are stated` IS `the proposal states each director's residential address and contact address`
             `s 215B(1)(d)(i) the number of shares of the amalgamated company is stated` IS `the proposal states the number of shares of the amalgamated company`
             `s 215B(1)(d)(ii) the rights, privileges, limitations and conditions attached to each share of the amalgamated company are stated` IS `the proposal states the rights and conditions attached to each share`
             `s 215B(1)(d)(iii) whether the shares are transferable or non-transferable and, if transferable, whether their transfer is subject to any condition or limitation, is stated` IS `the proposal states whether the shares are transferable and on what conditions`
             `s 215B(1)(e) a copy of the constitution of the amalgamated company is included` IS `the proposal includes a copy of the constitution of the amalgamated company`
             `s 215B(1)(f) the manner in which the shares of each amalgamating company are to be converted into shares of the amalgamated company is stated` IS `the proposal states how the shares of each amalgamating company are to be converted`
             `s 215B(1)(g) shares of an amalgamating company are not to be converted into shares of the amalgamated company` IS `some shares of an amalgamating company are not to be converted`
             `s 215B(1)(g) the consideration that the holders of those shares are to receive instead is stated` IS `the proposal states what the holders of those shares are to receive instead`
             `s 215B(1)(h) a payment is to be made to a member or director of an amalgamating company, other than a payment of the kind described in paragraph (g)` IS `a payment is to be made to a member or director of an amalgamating company`
             `s 215B(1)(h) that payment is stated` IS `the proposal states that payment`
             `s 215B(1)(i) details of any arrangement necessary to complete the amalgamation and to provide for the subsequent management and operation of the amalgamated company are stated` IS `the proposal gives details of the arrangements to complete the amalgamation`

@export Under section 215B(2), may the amalgamation proposal specify the date on which the amalgamation is intended to become effective?
GIVEN `the document is an amalgamation proposal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the document an amalgamation proposal?
      `the date specified is the date the amalgamation is intended to become effective` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the date specified the date on which the amalgamation is intended to become effective?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215B(2), may the amalgamation proposal specify the date on which the amalgamation is intended to become effective` IS
    `s 215B(2) the amalgamation proposal may specify the date` `the document is an amalgamation proposal` `the date specified is the date the amalgamation is intended to become effective`

@export Under section 215B(3), does the amalgamation proposal provide as the subsection requires for shares held by one amalgamating company in another?
GIVEN `shares of one amalgamating company are held by or for another` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are shares of one of the amalgamating companies held by or on behalf of another of the amalgamating companies?
      `the proposal cancels those shares without payment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the proposal provide for the cancellation of those shares without payment or other consideration when the amalgamation becomes effective?
      `the proposal converts those shares into shares of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the proposal provide for the conversion of those shares into shares of the amalgamated company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215B(3), does the amalgamation proposal provide as the subsection requires for shares held by one amalgamating company in another` IS
    `s 215B(3) the amalgamation proposal provides as the subsection requires` `shares of one amalgamating company are held by or for another` `the proposal cancels those shares without payment` `the proposal converts those shares into shares of the amalgamated company`

@export Under section 215B(4), is the cancellation of the shares deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of the Act?
GIVEN `the cancellation is a cancellation under section 215B` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the cancellation of the shares a cancellation under section 215B?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215B(4), is the cancellation of the shares deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of the Act` IS
    `s 215B(4) the cancellation of the shares is deemed to be a reduction of share capital within the meaning of the Act` `the cancellation is a cancellation under section 215B`

@export Under section 215B(5), may the name be the name of the amalgamated company?
GIVEN `the name of the amalgamated company` IS A `s 215B(5) the name` @desc What will the name of the amalgamated company be: the name of one of the amalgamating companies, a new name, or some other name?
      `the new name has been reserved under section 27(12B)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the new name been reserved under section 27(12B)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215B(5), may the name be the name of the amalgamated company` IS
    `s 215B(5) the name may be the name of the amalgamated company` `the name of the amalgamated company` `the new name has been reserved under section 27(12B)`

§§ `Section 215C: approval of the amalgamation proposal`

-- s 215C(1). The proposal must be approved, subject to the constitution, by the members of each amalgamating company by special resolution at a general meeting, and by any other person whose approval a provision would need.
@export Under section 215C(1), has the amalgamation proposal been approved as the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the kind of resolution passed` IS A `Kind of resolution` @desc What kind of resolution was passed: an ordinary resolution, a special resolution, or a resolution of the directors?
      `the kind of meeting at which it was passed` IS A `Kind of meeting` @desc What kind of meeting was it: an annual general meeting, an extraordinary general meeting, the statutory meeting, a meeting of a class of members, or a meeting of creditors?
      `the constitution of each amalgamating company was complied with in the approval` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the constitution of each amalgamating company complied with in the approval?
      `a provision of the proposal needs the approval of a person other than the members` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would a provision in the proposal, if it were an amendment to the constitution of an amalgamating company, need the approval of a person other than the members?
      `that other person has approved the proposal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that other person approved the amalgamation proposal?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(1), has the amalgamation proposal been approved as the subsection requires` IS
    `s 215C(1) the amalgamation proposal has been approved as the subsection requires` `the kind of resolution passed` `the kind of meeting at which it was passed` `the constitution of each amalgamating company was complied with in the approval` `a provision of the proposal needs the approval of a person other than the members` `that other person has approved the proposal`

-- s 215C(2). Before the general meeting, the board must resolve that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company, and make the solvency statements of sections 215I and 215J.
@export Under section 215C(2)(a), did the board resolve before the general meeting that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company?
GIVEN `the board resolved that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board resolve that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company?
      `the day the board resolved` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the board so resolve? (any date if it has not)
      `the day of the general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what day is (or was) the general meeting?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(2)(a), did the board resolve before the general meeting that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` IS
    `s 215C(2)(a) the board resolved before the general meeting that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` `the board resolved that the amalgamation is in the best interest of the amalgamating company` `the day the board resolved` `the day of the general meeting`

@export Under section 215C(2)(b), did the board make the solvency statement for the amalgamating company before the general meeting?
GIVEN `the board made the solvency statement for the amalgamating company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board make a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company in accordance with section 215I?
      `the day the board made the solvency statement` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the board make it? (any date if it has not)
      `the day of the general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what day is (or was) the general meeting?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(2)(b), did the board make the solvency statement for the amalgamating company before the general meeting` IS
    `s 215C(2)(b) the board made the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company before the general meeting` `the board made the solvency statement for the amalgamating company` `the day the board made the solvency statement` `the day of the general meeting`

@export Under section 215C(2)(c), did the board make the solvency statement for the amalgamated company before the general meeting?
GIVEN `the board made the solvency statement for the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board make a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company in accordance with section 215J?
      `the day the board made the solvency statement` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the board make it? (any date if it has not)
      `the day of the general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what day is (or was) the general meeting?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(2)(c), did the board make the solvency statement for the amalgamated company before the general meeting` IS
    `s 215C(2)(c) the board made the solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company before the general meeting` `the board made the solvency statement for the amalgamated company` `the day the board made the solvency statement` `the day of the general meeting`

-- s 215C(3). Each director who votes in favour must sign a declaration of the director's opinion and the grounds for it.
@export Under section 215C(3), must I, as a director who votes in favour, sign the declaration?
GIVEN `I vote in favour of the resolution and the solvency statements` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you, as a director, vote in favour of the resolution and the making of the statements mentioned in section 215C(2)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(3), must I, as a director who votes in favour, sign the declaration` IS
    `s 215C(3) the director must sign the declaration` `I vote in favour of the resolution and the solvency statements`

@export Under section 215C(3), does the declaration state what the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the declaration states my opinion that the conditions are satisfied` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the declaration state that, in the director's opinion, the conditions specified in section 215C(2)(a), 215I(1)(a) and (b) and 215J(1)(a) and (b) are satisfied?
      `the declaration states the grounds for that opinion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the declaration state the grounds for that opinion?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215C(3), does the declaration state what the subsection requires` IS
    `s 215C(3) the declaration states what the subsection requires` `the declaration states my opinion that the conditions are satisfied` `the declaration states the grounds for that opinion`

-- s 215C(4). The board must send members, at least 21 days before the general meeting, the proposal, the declarations, a statement of the directors' material interests and the further information a reasonable member needs.
@export Under section 215C(4), did the board send what the subsection requires to every member at least 21 days before the general meeting?
GIVEN `the day of the general meeting` IS A DATE @desc On what day is (or was) the general meeting?
      `the day the board sent the documents to every member` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the board send the documents to every member?
      `the board sent a copy of the amalgamation proposal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board send a copy of the amalgamation proposal?
      `the board sent a copy of the directors' declarations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it send a copy of the declarations given by the directors under section 215C(3)?
