      `which company continues` IS A `s 215D(1) which company continues` @desc Which company continues: the amalgamated holding company or the amalgamated subsidiary company?
      `the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating subsidiary company be cancelled without any payment or any other consideration?
      `the holding company's shareholders are issued the same shares in the subsidiary for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shareholders of the amalgamating holding company to be issued, and hold, the same number of shares in the amalgamated subsidiary company as they hold in the holding company, without payment or other consideration?
      `the shares of each amalgamating company other than those issued will be cancelled for nothing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the shares of each amalgamating company, except those issued to the holding company's shareholders, be cancelled without any payment or other consideration?
      `the constitution of the amalgamated company will be the same as that of the company whose shares are not cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the constitution of the amalgamated company be the same as the constitution of the amalgamating company whose shares are not cancelled?
