      `the directors are satisfied the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the directors of the holding company and of every amalgamating subsidiary company satisfied that the amalgamated company will be able to pay its debts as they fall due at the date the amalgamation is to become effective?
      `the persons named as directors in the resolutions will be the directors of the amalgamated company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will the person or persons named as director or directors in the resolution of each amalgamating company be the directors of the amalgamated company?
