§§ `Section 215I: the solvency statement for an amalgamating company`

-- s 215I(1) and (2). A statement by the board that it has formed the opinions (a) and (b), in the form of a written declaration (or, where the company is not exempt from audit, accompanied by the auditor's report).
@export Under section 215I(1), does the statement have the content the subsection requires?
GIVEN `the statement is by the board of directors of the amalgamating company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement made by the board of directors of the amalgamating company?
      `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company could not then be found unable to pay its debts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say the board has formed the opinion that, as regards the amalgamating company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which it could then be found to be unable to pay its debts?
      `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company's assets are not less than its liabilities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement say the board has formed the opinion that, at the date of the statement, the value of the amalgamating company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
      `the statement is a written declaration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement in the form of a written declaration?
      `the statement is accompanied by the auditor's report` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the company's affairs and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215I(1), does the statement have the content the subsection requires` IS
    `s 215I(1) the statement has the content the subsection requires` `the statement`
    WHERE
         `the statement` MEANS `s 215I statement` WITH
             `s 215I(1) it is a statement by the board of directors of the amalgamating company` IS `the statement is by the board of directors of the amalgamating company`
             `s 215I(1)(a) it says the board has formed the opinion that, as regards the amalgamating company's situation at the date of the statement, there is no ground on which the amalgamating company could then be found to be unable to pay its debts` IS `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company could not then be found unable to pay its debts`
             `s 215I(1)(b) it says the board has formed the opinion that, at the date of the statement, the value of the amalgamating company's assets is not less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamating company's assets are not less than its liabilities`
             `s 215I(2) it is in the form of a written declaration` IS `the statement is a written declaration`
             `s 215I(2)(b) it is accompanied by a report from the company's auditor that the auditor has inquired into the affairs of the amalgamating company and is of the opinion that the statement is not unreasonable given all the circumstances` IS `the statement is accompanied by the auditor's report`

