      `the board had regard to all other circumstances affecting the amalgamating company's assets and liabilities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board have regard to all other circumstances that the directors know or ought to know affect, or may affect, the value of the amalgamating company's assets and liabilities (including contingent liabilities)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
