    `s 215I(4)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` `the board had regard to the most recent financial statements of the amalgamating company` `the board had regard to all other circumstances affecting the amalgamating company's assets and liabilities`

@export Under section 215I(4)(b), may the board rely on the valuation or estimate?
