      `I vote in favour of or otherwise cause a section 215I solvency statement to be made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you vote in favour of, or otherwise cause, a solvency statement under section 215I to be made?
      `I had reasonable grounds for the opinions expressed in the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you have reasonable grounds for the opinions expressed in the statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
