    `s 215I(6) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` `I am a director of an amalgamating company` `I vote in favour of or otherwise cause a section 215I solvency statement to be made` `I had reasonable grounds for the opinions expressed in the statement`

@export Under section 215I(6), what is the most I may be sentenced to on conviction?
GIVEN `I am a director of an amalgamating company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director of an amalgamating company?
      `I vote in favour of or otherwise cause a section 215I solvency statement to be made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you vote in favour of, or otherwise cause, a solvency statement under section 215I to be made?
      `I had reasonable grounds for the opinions expressed in the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you have reasonable grounds for the opinions expressed in the statement?
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 210(9) penalty`
