             `s 215J(1)(b) it says the board has formed the opinion that the value of the amalgamated company's assets will not be less than the value of its liabilities (including contingent liabilities)` IS `the statement says the board has formed the opinion that the amalgamated company's assets will not be less than its liabilities`

