      `the Registrar has extended the 60-day period` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Registrar extended the 60-day period under section 359(7)?
      `the last day of the extended period` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the extended period? (day, month, year; any date if there is no extension)
