    `s 359(6) the last day for submitting the document evidencing deregistration` `the date the notice of transfer of registration was issued` `the Registrar has extended the 60-day period` `the last day of the extended period`

-- s 359(6): layer-1 rule called: `s 359(6) the foreign corporate entity has complied with the duty to submit the document evidencing deregistration`
@export Under section 359(6), has the foreign corporate entity complied with the duty to submit the document evidencing deregistration?
GIVEN `the date the notice of transfer of registration was issued` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the notice of transfer of registration issued? (day, month, year)
      `the Registrar has extended the 60-day period` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Registrar extended the 60-day period under section 359(7)?
      `the last day of the extended period` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the extended period? (day, month, year; any date if there is no extension)
      `the entity has submitted the document evidencing deregistration in its place of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the entity submitted to the Registrar a document evidencing that it has been deregistered in its place of incorporation?
      `the date the document was submitted` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the document submitted? (day, month, year; any date if it has not been)
      `the date today` IS A DATE @desc What is the date today? (day, month, year)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
