    `s 359(6) the foreign corporate entity has complied with the duty to submit the document evidencing deregistration` `the date the notice of transfer of registration was issued` `the Registrar has extended the 60-day period` `the last day of the extended period` `the entity has submitted the document evidencing deregistration in its place of incorporation` `the date the document was submitted` `the date today`

-- s 359(7): layer-1 rule called: `s 359(7) the Registrar may extend the 60-day period`
