DECIDE `Under section 359(8), may the Registrar waive or modify the condition` IS
    `s 359(8) the Registrar may waive or modify the condition` `the condition was imposed by the Registrar under section 359(2)`

-- s 359(9): layer-1 rule called: `s 359(9) the person aggrieved may appeal to the Minister`
