      `the date I ask about` IS A DATE @desc For which date do you want the answer? (day, month, year)
      `the provision of the Act pertains to companies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the provision of the Companies Act you ask about one that pertains to companies?
      `the regulations specify an adaptation, exception or modification of the provision for the entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the regulations specify an adaptation, exception or modification of the provision for the entity?
GIVETH A `s 361(1)(a) how a provision of the Act applies to the foreign corporate entity`
DECIDE `Under section 361(1)(a), how does a provision of the Act apply to the foreign corporate entity` IS
    `s 361(1)(a) the provision of the Act applies to the foreign corporate entity` `the Registrar has issued a notice of transfer of registration for the entity` `the date of registration the notice of transfer of registration specifies` `the date I ask about` `the provision of the Act pertains to companies` `the regulations specify an adaptation, exception or modification of the provision for the entity`

-- s 361(1)(b): layer-1 rule called: `s 361(1)(b) the foreign corporate entity has ceased to be registered as a foreign company under Division 2 of Part 11`
