§ `Section 362: revocation of the registration (only for a company that has not submitted the deregistration document)`

-- s 362(1): layer-1 rule called: `s 362(1) the Registrar may by order revoke the registration of the company`
@export Under section 362(1), may the Registrar by order revoke the registration of the company?
