      `the company has completed and has ready for delivery appropriate certificates for all registered holders of existing shares or debentures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the company completed, and does it have ready for delivery, appropriate certificates for all persons registered as holders of existing shares or debentures as at the date of registration?
      `the date the certificates were completed and ready for delivery` IS A DATE @desc On what date were the certificates completed and ready for delivery? (day, month, year; any date if they are not)
      `the date today` IS A DATE @desc What is the date today? (day, month, year)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 364(1), has the company completed the certificates, and does it have them ready for delivery, within 60 days after the date of registration` IS
    `s 364(1) the company has completed and has ready for delivery the certificates within 60 days after the date of registration` `the date of registration of the company` `the company has completed and has ready for delivery appropriate certificates for all registered holders of existing shares or debentures` `the date the certificates were completed and ready for delivery` `the date today`

