@export Under section 384(b), is the foreign company exempt from the provision of this Division?
GIVEN `regulations made under section 411 exempt the foreign company, or a class of foreign companies to which it belongs, from the provision of this Division` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that regulations made under section 411 exempt the foreign company, or a class of foreign companies to which it belongs, from the provision of this Division?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 384(b), is the foreign company exempt from the provision of this Division` IS
    `s 384(b) the foreign company is exempt from the provision of this Division` `regulations made under section 411 exempt the foreign company, or a class of foreign companies to which it belongs, from the provision of this Division`


§ `Section 386: Penalties`

